  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/IMG_8256.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Las personas usuarias del Centro de Dia de Onda han vivido un martes de Pascua muy animado con las alumnas de la escuela de sevillanas del Estudio &Aacute;gora, en la avenida Montendre, 36, y su profesora Mar&iacute;a &Aacute;ngeles S&aacute;nchez al frente. El alcalde, Ximo Huguet Lecha, y la teniente de alcalde de Pol&iacute;tica Social, Maria Carmen Aguilella Garc&iacute;a, les ha obsequidado con una pa&ntilde;oleta.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/Ximo-Huguet-visita-Centro-Alzheimer-Pascua-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Huguet y Aguiella han visitado por la tarde el Centro de D&iacute;a de la Asociaci&oacute;n de Familiares de Alzheimer (AFA).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/comencensevillanescentrediaonda-1.jpg\" alt=\"comencensevillanescentrediaonda-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/comencensevillanescentrediaonda-10.jpg\" alt=\"comencensevillanescentrediaonda-10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/comencensevillanescentrediaonda-12.jpg\" alt=\"comencensevillanescentrediaonda-12\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/comencensevillanescentrediaonda-13.jpg\" alt=\"comencensevillanescentrediaonda-13\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/comencensevillanescentrediaonda-14.jpg\" alt=\"comencensevillanescentrediaonda-14\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/comencensevillanescentrediaonda-15.jpg\" alt=\"comencensevillanescentrediaonda-15\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/comencensevillanescentrediaonda-17.jpg\" alt=\"comencensevillanescentrediaonda-17\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/comencensevillanescentrediaonda-3.jpg\" alt=\"comencensevillanescentrediaonda-3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/comencensevillanescentrediaonda-9.jpg\" alt=\"comencensevillanescentrediaonda-9\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/img_8251.jpg\" alt=\"img_8251\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/img_8252.jpg\" alt=\"img_8252\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/img_8253.jpg\" alt=\"img_8253\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/img_8254.jpg\" alt=\"img_8254\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/img_8255.jpg\" alt=\"img_8255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/img_8256.jpg\" alt=\"img_8256\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sevillanescentrediaonda/img_8257.jpg\" alt=\"img_8257\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />